{\b CDBurner10 - End User License & Third-Party Notices}\par
\par
CDBurner10 is a .NET 10 + WinUI 3 optical media authoring, burning, ripping, and DVD archiving suite.\par
\par
{\b Third-Party Components}\par
\bullet\  {\b StarBurn SDK / StarBurnX 15.7} (Rocket Division Software) - Optical disc burning and grabbing engine.\par
\bullet\  {\b BASS 2.4} (Un4seen Developments) & {\b ManagedBass} - Audio playback and decoding.\par
\bullet\  {\b libdvdnav / libdvdread / libdvdcss} (VideoLAN, GPLv2+) - DVD-Video navigation and CSS decryption.\par
\bullet\  {\b Windows App SDK / WinUI 3} (Microsoft Corporation, MIT) - Modern Windows UI framework.\par
\bullet\  {\b TagLibSharp} (LGPLv2.1) - Audio metadata reading.\par
